<title>USA: Allied raises qtly div, adds annual div.</title>
<headline>Allied raises qtly div, adds annual div.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON, D.C. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.41		     $0.38</p>
<p> Pay		   Dec. 31</p>
<p> Record		Dec. 13</p>
<p>Note: The company also declared an annual extra distribution of $0.45 per share, payable Jan. 31 for a Dec. 27 record date.</p>
<p>Full name is Allied Capital Corp 11.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
